          "summary": "傅里叶级数：在给定区间计算 a0、an、bn，并检查部分和逼近与间断点。",
          "answer": "Fourier 级数：a0=0；a1=0，b1=2；a2=0，b2=-1；a3=0，b3=2/3；a4=0，b4=-1/2；a5=0，b5=2/5；截断到 n=5。",
          "answer_value": null,
          "exact": "2*sin(x) - sin(2*x) + 2*sin(3*x)/3 - sin(4*x)/2 + 2*sin(5*x)/5",
          "approx": null,
