              "id": "coefficients",
              "title": "计算傅里叶系数",
              "latex": "a_0=\\frac{2}{T}\\int f,\\quad a_n=\\frac{2}{T}\\int f\\cos\\frac{2\\pi nx}{T}",
              "detail": "区间长度 T=2*pi；计算到 n=5。"
